wp:comment.wp:comment_content:
You can use this to get assembly version (11 for SQL 2012):

$v.GetName().Version

I think you can replace this line:

if ((($v.FullName.Split(','))[1].Split('='))[1].Split('.')[0] -ne '9') {

with this:

if ($v.GetName().Version -ne '9') {

